# Question : https://leetcode.com/problems/valid-parentheses/description/

# Valid Parentheses — Solution

## Approach — Stack

Aapan string madhun ek-ek bracket check karu.

- Opening bracket `(`, `{`, `[` asel tar Stack madhe push karu.
- Closing bracket `)`, `}`, `]` asel tar Stack cha top check karu.
- Top bracket cha corresponding opening bracket nasel tar string invalid aahe.
- Shevti Stack empty asel tarch string valid aahe.

### C++ Solution

```cpp
class Solution {
public:
    bool isValid(string s) {
        stack<char> st;

        for (char ch : s) {

            // Opening bracket asel tar Stack madhe push karu
            if (ch == '(' || ch == '{' || ch == '[') {
                st.push(ch);
            }
            else {
                // Closing bracket sathi Stack empty asel tar invalid
                if (st.empty()) {
                    return false;
                }

                // Stack madhla top bracket check karu
                char top = st.top();

                // Current closing bracket sathi
                // correct opening bracket aahe ka te check karu
                if ((ch == ')' && top != '(') ||
                    (ch == '}' && top != '{') ||
                    (ch == ']' && top != '[')) {
                    return false;
                }

                // Matching pair sapadla, mhanun top remove karu
                st.pop();
            }
        }

        // Saglya brackets che matching pairs zhale pahijet
        // mhanun Stack empty asne required aahe
        return st.empty();
    }
};
